    {
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Each service records the same pipeline metrics. Read them in path order: ingress, sequencer, cluster client, sealer, executor, state writer, state mirror.\n\n- **Busy share near 1:** the loop is saturated. It is the bottleneck, or it sits behind one.\n- **Blocked share above 0:** the loop has work but its output is full. The bottleneck is after it.\n- **A queue that grows:** the loop that reads it is too slow.\n- **A step p99 that jumps:** that step holds the latency tail.\n\nThe loop metrics flush every 100 ms, so a share below 1 s of window is noisy."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Saturation",
      "collapsed": false,
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "The share of time each loop works. A loop near 100 % is saturated.",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service, host_id, loop) (rate(kardamom_loop_nanoseconds_total{state=\"busy\"}[1m])) / sum by (service, host_id, loop) (rate(kardamom_loop_nanoseconds_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{host_id}} {{loop}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "title": "Busy share by loop",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
